{title: You Are Jesus}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
You are my safety,
You are my shelter,
You are everything worth trusting in life.
Light of heaven, and Morning Star,
Peace is knowing who You are.
You are Jesus, Jesus.

Verse 2
I am never forsaken,
You have me in the palm of Your hand.
When the storms of life are raging,
You are the Ark and my sanctuary.

Verse 3
When the problems of life surround me,
You are the anchor,
The anchor that holds my life.

Verse 4
(repeat first part)
